# Lessons learned

Cumulative record of mistakes surfaced by PR reviews and completed workflows.
Appended by the `pr-review-fixer` sub-agent after `/mi-continue` applies
review fixes, and by the `lessons-distiller` sub-agent at
`/mi-complete-workflow` Step 3.5 (stage 8). The planning and implementation
chains read this file before writing code so the same mistakes are not
repeated — `config.md`'s `## Lessons learned` section points here.

Append-only; managed by `scripts/lessons.sh`. Each entry is a `## L-NNN` block:

